  <metadata xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">
    <dc:identifier id="BookId">urn:uuid:8b341f20-9482-40as-arkun-cycle-vol1</dc:identifier>
    <dc:title>Stolen Breath</dc:title>
    <dc:creator>J.D. Alfaro</dc:creator>
    <dc:language>en-US</dc:language>
    <dc:publisher>J.D. Alfaro</dc:publisher>
    <dc:date>2026-10-02</dc:date>
    <dc:description>In a world choked by copper dust, every breath has a price. High above the toxic smog of Dome Alpha, Lord Vram commands the sky with wings built for war, while a lethal electrical storm consumes his mind. In the rust-slicked alleys below, Tsunari survives by her claws. When they meet, her touch acts as a living ground wire—silencing his agony and sparking an alliance that will tear the sky apart.</dc:description>
    <dc:rights>© 2026 J.D. Alfaro. All rights reserved.</dc:rights>
